# call takes one, two or three arguments (the book, call-receivers): four are no form of it -- answer 5.
# Plan M11 5v: the declarations of ordinary Structures live in the data part of main; the root holds the call main().
sub: main () (
    Args:
        int: a 1
    Vars:
        int: x 1
    Body:
        x := x + a
)
    call(Args Vars Vars Body)
main()
